# Responsibility: Acquire exclusive leases for canonical PlanningScene resources.
# Keys are "world:<id>", "attached:<id>" and canonical ACM pairs
# "acm:<lexicographically-smaller>|<larger>".
# Across leases, world/attached keys for one object also conflict with every
# ACM pair containing that object ID because object removal implicitly removes
# those ACM entries. Related keys in one request are acquired atomically and
# may share the same lease.
string owner_id
string[] resource_keys

# Lease TTL is measured with the coordinator's steady clock, never simulation
# time. It must be positive.
builtin_interfaces/Duration requested_ttl
---
string lease_id
builtin_interfaces/Duration granted_ttl
PlanningSceneOperationResult result
